{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/3f1b744a2d4389fa2b62b474604d693e.avif?t=1757996359\" width=596 height=34 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hangtime! is a volleyball roguelike about instinct, timing, and high-stakes momentum. Every rally is fast and tense \u2014 spikes, blocks, and midair reads with everything on the line. Lose once and you\u2019re done, win and you keep climbing. Play solo or team up for chaotic local multiplayer matches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/d12c30a43c823fcc683db8733f45733e.poster.avif?t=1757996359\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/d12c30a43c823fcc683db8733f45733e.webm?t=1757996359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/d12c30a43c823fcc683db8733f45733e.mp4?t=1757996359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/65a6f5c05aa3d758714c356dd1062087.avif?t=1757996359\" width=596 height=34 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Techniques aren\u2019t just stat boosts\u2014they change how you play. The more you stack, the weirder and more powerful your style becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few favorites:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadball Set</strong> \u2013 slows the set at its highest point, letting you reposition last second.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hook Tip</strong> \u2013 fast, sharp drop that dodges blockers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pipe</strong> \u2013 leap from the back row for huge surprise spikes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/ed4ea567c2d266b108d24b0ef22185dc.poster.avif?t=1757996359\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/ed4ea567c2d266b108d24b0ef22185dc.webm?t=1757996359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/ed4ea567c2d266b108d24b0ef22185dc.mp4?t=1757996359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/c28b8479e37bc264673edad15d935dc3.avif?t=1757996359\" width=596 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two teams play the same\u2014and every one of them is scary in their own way.<br>Some hit hard. Some never miss. Some twist the tempo until you lose the beat.<br>And when the stakes get high, the real monsters show up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll hear names like <strong>Tenzio</strong> whispered in the locker room\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and at the top? A giant awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/bbca03f2f98c59caa4f9a90ae8584648.poster.avif?t=1757996359\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/bbca03f2f98c59caa4f9a90ae8584648.webm?t=1757996359\" 